APIs for Standardization Pipeline
1. Upload Archive:
curl -vk -X POST https://swcstandardization.computational-neuromorpho.org/nmo/upload $(for f in neuron_archive/*.swc; do printf ' -F files=@%s' "$f"; done)

2. Process SWC files standardization:
curl -vk -X POST https://swcstandardization.computational-neuromorpho.org/nmo/SWC_STD

Optional Check and correction of branchTag
curl -vk -X POST https://swcstandardization.computational-neuromorpho.org/nmo/SWC_STD -F "checkCorrectBranchTag=true" -F "branchtype=4"

3. Download Standardized SWC files
curl -vk -X GET "https://swcstandardization.computational-neuromorpho.org/nmo/download" -o swc_standardized.zip

APIs for Long Connections Pipeline
1. Upload Archive:
curl -vk -X POST https://swcstandardization.computational-neuromorpho.org/nmo/upload $(for f in long_connection_archive/*.swc; do printf ' -F files=@%s' "$f"; done)

2. Process Disjoint subtrees and Long connections
curl -vk -X POST "https://swcstandardization.computational-neuromorpho.org/nmo/connect_disjoint_subtrees" -F "checkLongConnections=true" -F "stdevX=6"

3. Download SWC files without long connections and disjoint subtrees
curl -vk -X GET "https://swcstandardization.computational-neuromorpho.org/nmo/download_connected" -o swc_connected.zip


APIs for Pyramidal AutoTag Pipeline
1. Upload Archive:
curl -vk -X POST https://swcstandardization.computational-neuromorpho.org/nmo/upload $(for f in pyramidals_archive/*.swc; do printf ' -F files=@%s' "$f"; done)

2. Process AutoTagging of pyramidals
curl -vk -X GET "https://swcstandardization.computational-neuromorpho.org/nmo/CorrectTag"

3. Download AutoTagged pyramidal files
curl -vk -X GET "https://swcstandardization.computational-neuromorpho.org/nmo/download_corrected_tags" -o swc_auto_tag.zip
